      "text": "During Main Building construction, the underground garage and Lot A are closed to general parking; the connecting road and stairs are blocked, and the locked pedestrian door requires staff cards, while approved controlled access remains for construction/facilities personnel. The garage temporarily stores materials, with cleared personal items sent to lost and found. Lot C is the alternative, though space cannot be checked or guaranteed, and Lot A should reopen when construction ends. Guidance may explain posted closures and Lot C’s location; visitors, delivery drivers, and contractors may nevertheless reach the control line and need rerouting or delivery confirmation."
